== Effects ==
* For the duration of the current floor:
** Grants {{i|Spirit of the Night}} and +1.5 [[Damage]].
** Turns Isaac's red [[heart container]]s into {{e|Bone Heart||bone hearts}}.
** Causes a {{cu|Darkness}} that cannot be dispelled.

== Notes ==
* When the effect reverts, all bone hearts remaining will be restored to heart containers.
** Actual bone hearts remain unchanged.
** If Isaac travels to the next floor with ''only'' empty temporary bone hearts (either by donation or with {{t|Crow Heart}}), '''he will die''' as his resulting health after reverting are only empty heart containers.
* The card's effect persists in the {{i|Knife Piece 2}} abandoned area, allowing for easier completion of the chase sequence if flight was not acquired before.
* Picking up health-increasing items while '''XIX - The Sun?''''s effect is active will add normal heart containers.
** Using '''XIX - The Sun?''' again will convert them into bone hearts.

== Strategy ==
* '''XIX - The Sun?''' negates the downsides of items that remove [[heart container]]s on pickup (such as {{i|Dead Cat}} and {{i|Brittle Bones}}) since it converts all [[heart container]]s into {{e|Bone Heart}}s.
* The bone hearts allow for more uses of the {{r|Sacrifice Room}}.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Night Light}}: Curse of Darkness is not removed, regardless of whether Night Light is picked up before or after using the card. However, the visual effect is still lessened.
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

